From: ProgrammerIn-wonderland <3838shah@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] ath12k: Add in Romulus ath12k enumeration fix

Bypass rfkill config check early to prevent WiFi 7 enumeration stall
on Microsoft Surface Laptop 7 (Snapdragon X Elite).

Signed-off-by: ProgrammerIn-wonderland <3838shah@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c
index 8b9f7142..e2d93e11 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c
@@ -76,6 +76,8 @@ static int ath12k_core_rfkill_config(struct ath12k_base *ab)
 
 	if (!(ab->target_caps.sys_cap_info & WMI_SYS_CAP_INFO_RFKILL))
 		return 0;
+
+	return 0; // Microsoft Surface Laptop 7 Enumeration hack
 
 	if (ath12k_acpi_get_disable_rfkill(ab))
 		return 0;
-- 
2.45.0